    "Negative probability or partition function",
    "Entropy decreasing in closed system",
    "Wrong thermodynamic limit scaling",
    "Missing extensive property of entropy",
    "Incorrect Boltzmann factor exp(-E/kT)",
    "Equilibrium distribution with imaginary temperature"
